Subject: [PATCH] Remove incident-related roots from the Snowflake CA bundle

Remove AAA Certificate Services and emSign ECC Root CA - G3, which
can anchor chains containing the compromised eMudhra intermediates.
Preserve unrelated roots and OCSP/transport code. Add only the
independently self-signed SSL.com TLS ECC Root CA 2022, already trusted
by Azure Linux, to preserve legitimate SSL.com issuer lookup and trust
without restoring AAA.

--- a/vendor/github.com/influxdata/gosnowflake/cacert.go
+++ b/vendor/github.com/influxdata/gosnowflake/cacert.go
@@ -217,30 +217,6 @@
 FGdTbHFcJoRNdVq2fmBWqU2t+5sel/MN2dKXVHfaPRK34B7vCAas+YWH6aLcr34YEoP9VhdBLtUp
